564 0 obj
<<
/Title (The main design challenges were fitting the required functionality into a compact two-layer board, maintaining adequate clearance around the LQFP-64 MCU, routing multiple peripheral interfaces and providing a practical ground-plane arrangement. Additional care was required for the MCU power and VCAP connections, USB routing, oscillator placement and external SWD accessibility. PCB rule violations encountered during layout were corrected by adjusting routing and clearances while retaining the intended functional architecture.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 442 0 R
>>
endobj
